rumb; ticket rows\n   FILE: tools/watch-assets/cc-cockpit-mount.js, tools/watch-assets/cc-cockpit.css, tools/watch-assets/cockpit-lists.js\n   CHANGE: Suppress the auto-opening tour (localStorage dismissed flag, or open only on demand). Move BACK into the app-nav `.nav-actions` as a `.btn-pill` next to the Hive/Cockpit tabs. Render the ticket id inside `.ticket-idx` (border:3px solid var(--cockpit-orange);border-radius:4px;background:rgba(201,120,74,.28)) with the lane modifier class, and use the 4-column ticket-row grid `36px minmax(0,1fr) auto 20px`.",
