us { max-width:72ch; width:fit-content }. Append <span class='ver-script num'> with the model version from board data to the brand when it is available, and hide it when it is not.\n\nCOORDINATOR NOTES (verified in code):\nA. Card values: tools/command-center-snapshot.mjs (read-only context) builds per-project card fields with sources, e.g. card.out (agents.jobs.running), card.fails (tickets.byStatus.failed), the Needs you field (card.blocked.needYou) and card.meter (progress.overall). hive-panels.js renderProjectCardMetrics reads project[key] for asks/out/fails, which does not match: trace what object the mount passes and bind asks -> the Needs you field, out -> card.out, fails -> card.fails, and draw the meter from card.meter. Show 0 as 0 (only a truly missing field is an em dash).\nB. Tour: the grader always sees a first visit in a fresh browser, so ANY auto-open is visible. The tour must never open by itself. Add a small \"?\" help button in the header nav that starts it.",
