te; ids must be consistent everywhere (show T-0615 style, not two different numbers; a run id once, shortened). Use the robot-head assets for the centre robot if it fits (tools/watch-assets/robot-head.js, read-only). Brand glitch: call tools/watch-assets/cc-glitch.js on the brand wordmark (read-only).",
