+        "problem": "In every node card the 'fails' row is clipped at the bottom edge. Each card also has a large empty band between the yellow header and the 'asks' row, so the three key/value rows get pushed down and cut off.",
+        "where": "Desktop: all five node cards (project-swarm, agent-data-business, swarm-practice, parts-request-app, blackbook-app). Phone: the same cards.",
