+        "change": "Render the mockup's <svg class=\"hive-ring-text\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 200\"> with the <path id=\"hive-orbit-arc\" d=\"M 34 118 A 66 66 0 1 1 166 118\"> and <textPath href=\"#hive-orbit-arc\">, placed inside .hive-core-ui (position:absolute; inset:-8%). Do not position a plain text node absolutely."
