+        "where": "Desktop hub panel, left and right card columns around the opus ring",
+        "file": "tools/watch-assets/cc-hive.css, cc-hive-mount.js",
+        "change": "Stop absolutely positioning cards with fixed top offsets. Put each side in a flex column: .hive-side{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;justify-content:center}. Drop the fixed card height and use .hive-card{height:auto;min-height:0;overflow:visible}, with .hive-card .rows{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;row-gap:6px;padding:10px 12px 12px}. Compute the SVG link endpoints in cc-hive-mount.js from getBoundingClientRect() after layout, not from preset coordinates."
