+        "problem": "The panels contradict each other on agent counts. Lanes and Savings adds up to 5 (3/0/1/1) while the header and stat card say 10 agents live. Throughput says 4/5 projects running, but only one project card shows RUNNING (the others say NEEDS YOU or IDLE). Every session log entry shows the same '1s'.",
