+        "change": "Drop the two flex columns; make the stage position:relative with a fixed aspect, and absolutely position each node at angle a_i = -90deg + i*360/n on an ellipse (left: calc(50% + rx*cos(a)), top: calc(50% + ry*sin(a)), transform: translate(-50%,-50%)), with rx about 40% and ry about 38% of the stage so the nodes ring the core."
