+        "where": "Between every project node and the ring, most visibly nodes 05, 06 and 02",
+        "file": "tools/watch-assets/cc-hive-mount.js",
+        "change": "Emit particles along a quadratic bezier from the card's inner edge to the ring rim, 1-2px size, velocity along the path, and draw a 6-10px tail by re-plotting the previous position at lower alpha. Use the lane colour at ~0.8 alpha with additive blending only within 30px of the ring; drop the white-hot core blend. Let a thinner continuation stream run past the rim toward the core as in the target."
